      "position": "top",
      "html": "<div class=\"tool\" data-tool=\"brief\"><h2>Project brief builder</h2><p>Answer a few questions to get a clear, professional brief you can send to several providers. It stays in your browser until you copy, download or email it.</p>\n<form novalidate>\n<fieldset><legend>The basics</legend><div class=\"tool-grid\">\n<label>Service needed<select name=\"service\"><option value=\"accounting\">Accounting</option><option value=\"payroll\">Payroll</option><option value=\"hr-outsourcing\">HR</option><option value=\"management-consulting\">Consulting</option><option value=\"web-design\">Web design</option><option value=\"digital-marketing\">Marketing</option><option value=\"branding\">Branding</option><option value=\"legal-services\">Legal</option><option value=\"it-cyber-security\">IT &amp; cyber</option><option value=\"virtual-assistants\">Virtual assistants</option><option value=\"translation\">Translation</option><option value=\"recruitment\">Recruitment</option><option value=\"company-formation\">Company formation</option><option value=\"other\">Other professional service</option></select></label>\n<label>Business name and what you do<input name=\"business\" placeholder=\"e.g. Acme Ltd, online homeware shop\"></label>\n<label>Country or region<input name=\"country\" placeholder=\"e.g. United Kingdom, selling into the EU\"></label>\n<label>Team size<input name=\"size\" placeholder=\"e.g. 12 staff\"></label>\n</div></fieldset>\n<fieldset><legend>The work</legend>\n<label>What do you need?<textarea name=\"need\" placeholder=\"Describe the work, the current situation and any problems to solve.\"></textarea></label>\n<label>What does success look like?<textarea name=\"goals\" placeholder=\"e.g. payroll run on time in two countries, with no penalties.\"></textarea></label>\n<label>Deliverables<textarea name=\"deliverables\" placeholder=\"e.g. monthly payslips, filings, a year-end report.\"></textarea></label>\n</fieldset>\n<fieldset><legend>Budget and timing</legend><div class=\"tool-grid\">\n<label>Budget<input name=\"budget\" placeholder=\"e.g. up to 2,000 per month, or open\"></label>\n<label>Start date or deadline<input name=\"deadline\" placeholder=\"e.g. start in January\"></label>\n<label>Working style<select name=\"mode\"><option>Remote is fine</option><option>On site</option><option>Hybrid</option></select></label>\n<label>Languages or time zones<input name=\"languages\" placeholder=\"e.g. English and German, UK hours\"></label>\n</div></fieldset>\n<div class=\"tool-actions\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Create my brief</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"reset\">Clear</button></div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"result\" data-result hidden aria-live=\"polite\"><h3>Your brief</h3><pre class=\"brief-out\"></pre><div class=\"tool-actions\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-copy>Copy brief</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"button\" data-download>Download .txt</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"button\" data-email>Open in email</button></div><p class=\"tool-status\" role=\"status\"></p></div></div>"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "h2": "What makes a good brief",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Context:</strong> who you are, where you operate and what has happened so far.</li><li><strong>The problem or goal:</strong> what you need to change and why.</li><li><strong>Deliverables:</strong> what you expect to receive, and when.</li><li><strong>Constraints:</strong> budget range, deadlines, languages, time zones and tools.</li><li><strong>What you want back:</strong> experience, approach, timeline and a clear price.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "How to compare the quotes",
      "html": "<p>Put the replies side by side. Check what’s included, how the price is structured, who does the work, and what credentials and insurance they hold. Our guide to <a href=\"/blog/fixed-fee-hourly-or-retainer/\">fixed fees, hourly rates and retainers</a> helps you compare different pricing models.</p>"
    }
